    "disposition": "stock_product_mixture_context",
    "reasoning": "Continuation1201 supersedes the prior administrative no-proposal rationale. Sixteen bounded basal or combined mixture proposals cover seventeen prepared-material occurrences; JCM462/463 share their demonstrated pre-addition basal formulation. Seven other Sol.1 groups enumerate separate additions without a demonstrated standalone material. Provider grouping errors for late vitamins, cysteine and carbonate are explicitly excluded where original preparation instructions require it. All24 occurrence scopes are individually recorded. Original JCM route(s) returning Nothing found are unsuccessful retrievals only; positive recipe interpretation uses the separately captured TOGO provider record. No direct original-page inspection is claimed for those routes. Correct four prepared-material quantity bases: JCM167 uses q.s.900mL; TOGO M683/JCM665 uses q.s.1L; inherited DSMZ29 C/D/E50/450/25mL values describe water inputs and provider group volumes, not whole prepared-stock aliquots; M2491 prose supplies a per-litre formulation basis. No water-plus-stock volume or concentration calculation is made. The other20 occurrence outcomes are inherited unchanged and explicitly identified.",
    "applicability": "Final-correction successor for this exact frozen case digest, raw source object and all original occurrence IDs. Every original occurrence is bound individually in source-occurrence-bindings.json; unchanged case58 contexts are identified as inherited rather than newly reviewed. All existing nonpositive decisions, source/version/quantity and cross-shard obligations remain. This is author-stage scientific curation, not final owner/export approval; new independent final-byte review is pending.",
